#~ shadowed_macro
# fixedbugs, defect 2344 (panel 237's R2 and R3): `CCC_OVERRIDE_OPTIONS`,
# silent under its leading `#`, hands every clang a `-D` of
# `__builtin_add_overflow` reporting nothing, which stands before every
# header and every guard, so an `i64` sum past the top printed
# `-9223372036854775808` at exit 0. Refused as `shadowed_macro`, its note
# naming the variable.

function main()
    big: i64 = 9223372036854775807
    print(big + args().len())
